      "message": "Hi, thanks for the comment.\n\nThe full context is in b/543101585. TLDR is that we are trying to integrate git-repo with ABFS for dev\u0027s experience. We are seeking 30 seconds syncing, and the git-config calling each-time in multi projects is causing roughly 5~6 seconds latency so we want to try improve this part",
